  message: <<EOM
C9 services have not been enabled and no accounts have been changed.
After installing the selected hardware package and creating a nonroot account:

    c9-system-setup --profile intel --user USER

The other profile is virtualbox. The command is chroot-safe and does
not start services, load modules, create passwords, or generate machine keys.
VirtualBox validates the installer and SDDM login only. Mango itself requires
supported physical DRM graphics; no nested or alternate compositor is shipped.
